{"version":1,"content":"<p>第61屆金鐘獎「戲劇類」頒獎典禮因遇上颱風「薔琵」來襲，延至今日（26日）登場，由陳庭妮首次獨挑大梁跨界主持，這也是她產後首次登上大舞台表演《大戲劇攷》，她以粉紅色短洋裝現身及打頭陣演出，短短10分鐘的時間，出盡渾身解數表演，獲網友大讚出色</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:00:48.586999+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:16:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:58:06.671471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:58:06.671471+00:00","content_hash":"dc0376bbc23d051cc9e05f6d8decbb23e014f3697b3a419cea47e334c24da28e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}